<title>UK: London tea sale average price.</title>
<headline>London tea sale average price.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average for the 7,036 packages of landed tea sold at this weeks London sale was 116.63 pence a kilo against 119.74 last week and 112.16 a year ago.</p>
<p>The average for the 7,036 pkgs sold so far this year is 116.63 pence against 112.16 pence for the 8,519 pkgs sold by this stage last year.</p>
</text>
